\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] InvRevLex \[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] and the default \
ordering \[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] InvDeg[Lex]\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] are not \
admissible as Groebner basis monomial orderings.  \
